    "title": "Summary",
    "columns": 1,
    "hidden": false,
    "content": "<p>Senior full-stack engineer with <strong>12+ years</strong> of experience designing and building <em>scalable</em> distributed systems. Passionate about developer tooling, open source, and <strong>mentoring</strong> the next generation of engineers.</p><p>Core competencies:</p><ul><li>Full-stack web development with <strong>React</strong>, TypeScript, and Node.js</li><li>Cloud infrastructure on AWS and GCP (<em>certified</em>)</li><li>System design for high-throughput, low-latency applications</li><li>Open source maintainer and community builder</li></ul><p>Learn more at <a href=\"https://alexandrachen.dev\">alexandrachen.dev</a> or check out my <strong>GitHub</strong> projects.</p>"
